 164+ 3DD8              ; Startup regression for the dynamic page allocator. It allocates all nine
 165+ 3DD8              ; pages in ascending order, verifies exhaustion, releases in reverse order,
 166+ 3DD8              ; then confirms page07 can be allocated and released again.
 167+ 3DD8              ; OUT: carry clear on pass; carry set on failure. Startup halts on failure.
